  "feature2": {
    "prompt": "IterativeImputer should be verified to correctly support the new fill_value parameter. When the initial_strategy is set to 'constant', users must be able to provide a user-defined constant value \u2013 including np.nan \u2013 that is used during the first imputation round. This functionality is essential to allow finer control over how missing values are initialized, mirroring the approach taken in SimpleImputer. The correct propagation of the fill_value parameter into the underlying imputation process is critical for ensuring consistent and accurate data handling.",
